      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "--walk-forward d0,d1,... reruns the WHOLE loop per period\nfold i evolves with cutoff_date=d_i and touch-once scores [d_i,d_{i+1})\nvalidation only: fold archives are checkpointed, not persisted to the prerun DB",
